# AI Virtual Assistant

A web-based AI Virtual Assistant built with the MERN stack and Gemini API.

## Tech Stack

- React.js
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Gemini API
- JavaScript

## Features

- AI-powered conversations
- Voice interaction
- Hindi and English support
- Responsive user interface

